  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• In a small bowl, combine ginger paste, sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925476212f41a9d46b6fde/step-db0ebb00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat, add sweet chilli mixture and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925476212f41a9d46b6fde/step-05695a10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-sade plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, carrot and Japanese-style dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925476212f41a9d46b6fde/step-47c79e20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build tacos by spreading tortillas with the mayonnaise, then top with Japanese salad and tofu.\n• Spoon over any remaining sweet chilli glaze to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925476212f41a9d46b6fde/step-1ed8df30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
